This is a licensing and IPR framework for a draft technical specification. It does **not** constitute an official position of the European Commission, a standards-track document of any standards-developing organisation, or legal advice. Implementers and contributors are encouraged to obtain independent legal review before commercial deployment or before contributing patented material.

