## 7. Contact and about

For questions about this license, to report a patent disclosure, or to request clarification on the scope of the RAND-Z commitment, please open an issue in this repository — <https://github.com/european-business-wallet/sbm-design-study> — or contact the maintainer(s) listed in `README.md`.

This `LICENSE` overview and the `IPR.md` document are themselves licensed under CC BY 4.0, so other projects may adopt and adapt this framework. When doing so, update §2.1 and §3 to reflect the adopting repository's file layout, replace the attribution in §2.2, and name that repository in §7: those four places are what make this document true of the repository it ships in, and `make doc-lint` and `make versions` check the first three.
